OL,3,GNEWSAFire service changes approved
OL,4,Aafter previous backlash
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to restructure Oxfordshire Fire
OL,7,Fand Rescue Service, including proposals
OL,8,Fto redistribute efforts to five towns
OL,9,Facross the county, have been approved.
OL,11,FAmong the plans for the future of the
OL,12,Fservice are placing full-time
OL,13,Ffirefighters in Bicester, Chipping
OL,14,FNorton, Faringdon, Witney and Henley
OL,15,Fduring daytimes.
OL,17,FThe proposals were backed by
OL,18,FOxfordshire County Council's cabinet at
OL,19,Fa meeting on Tuesday, months after
OL,20,Fprevious plans were met with widespread
OL,21,Fbacklash.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
