OL,3,GNEWSAFire service changes approved
OL,4,Aafter previous backlash
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn April, the authority was forced to
OL,7,Fditch an earlier version of the plans
OL,8,Fafter Oxfordshire members of the Fire
OL,9,FBrigades Union (FBU) voted
OL,10,Foverwhelmingly in favour of strike
OL,11,Faction.
